ntext.\n    53\t\n    54\t## Build and test\n    55\t\n    56\t```bash\n    57\tnpm ci\n    58\tnpm run lint\n    59\tnpm test\n    60\tnpm run build\n    61\t```\n    62\t\n    63\t## Release\n    64\t\n    65\tMerges to `main` need two reviews and a code owner review for prompts, config, infra, and manifests.\n    66\t`deploy.yml` builds, signs, and deploys by digest to the `production` environment, which has required\n    67\treviewers. Emergency deploys use the same workflow with `emergency: true` and must name an owner,\n    68\ta reason, and an end date; the workflow opens a follow-up review issue.\n    69\t\n    70\t## Owners\n    71\t\n    72\t- Accountable party: Northbay Clinic Group, Patient Access (VP Patient Access)\n    73\t- Operational owner: agent-platform team, `#agent-platform-oncall`","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e7e91a56-8e26-4882-b939-10679f6422bd","uuid":"627f2c5d-e77d-41d9-ae01-8ec76c7117e6","timestamp":"2026-10-02T14:32:57.009Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"H001 P27 B11 k8s/deployment.yaml 67 'securityContext:'\nH002 P27 B11 k8s/deployment.yaml 86 'securityContext:'\nH003 P27 B11 k8s/deployment.yaml 135 'securityContext:'\nH004 P27 B11 k8s/deployment.yaml 152 'securityContext:'\nH005 P31 B02 infra/terraform/github.tf 100 'Resource = \"*\"'\nH006 P40 R13 src/agent/loop.ts 37 ''\nH007 P40 R13 src/agent/loop.ts 38 'try {'\nH008 P40 R13 src/agent/loop.ts 106 'try {'\nH009 P40 R13 src/tools/executor.ts 84 ''\nH010 P40 R13 src/tools/executor.ts 85 'try {'\nH011 P50 E03 src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts 78 'c.listTools(),'\n    28\t\n    29\t## High-impact actions\n    30\t\n    31\t`config/policy.yaml` lists the tools that need a staff approval before they run. The agent asks for\n    32\tthe approval, a front-desk lead or clinic manager approves it in the staff console, and the agent\n    33\tretries with the approval ID. Approvals expire after 15 minutes.\n    34\t\n    35\t## Stopping the agent\n    36\t\n    37\tOperat